        "image_alt": "Six women in black and beige stand side by side in a bright studio.",
        "heading": "Size tells you if it closes. <em>Shape</em> tells you if it works.",
        "text": "<p>Two women can wear the same size and suit completely different cuts. A wrap dress, a straight trouser, an A-line skirt: whether each one looks the way you hoped depends on your proportions, not on the number on the label.</p><p>So every product on SaahVay carries the shapes it is selected for, and says in one line why the cut works. You still choose your normal size on the product page.</p>",
